{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】一股清勁至強風程度的偏東氣流正影響廣東沿岸。本港地區今日(11月22日)天氣預測，大致多雲，稍後有一兩陣微雨，氣溫徘徊在23度左右，吹和緩至清勁偏東風，離岸及高地間中吹強風。</p>\n<p>展望星期一多雲，初時風勢仍然頗大。本周中期轉吹偏北風，天氣轉涼及有幾陣雨。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T23:19:54.981467+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T22:54:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T23:13:23.120272+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T23:13:23.120272+00:00","content_hash":"50b1a150a4f7d924e493411aace9ac80254269d01c8bff602f30d310cd81fafa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}